spellbook-crate-of-demonology-name = Crate of Demonology

spellbook-crate-of-demonology-description =
    The all in one crate for all your demonology needs summoned by arcane power!
    Can be used for enchanting your gear, or summoning demons to join your crusade of chaos!
    Note no guarantees magic inks arent curses or that summoned demons wont try to kill you. No refunds!
